-><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-76129f06-a7fe-4e8a-a130-59e01f3c8669\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-482c7264-ddfb-4abd-b33c-36b9bd67d3ef\">빙하가 녹으면서 서식지가 줄어들면서 북극곰 멸종을 가속화되고 있는 거죠.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-29f7ecf7-e080-4177-a0d0-d1b5184949c4\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-b4ab7e9e-3bfe-4a27-be41-4105f28c90f7\">이런 환경 오염은 동물뿐만 아니라 인간의 생활에도 큰 영향을 끼치고 있어요.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f93ea558-dc62-413d-ba50-d8f22118c8db\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-500a756e-b1da-4ce6-b36a-56ae1e66623a\">우리도 경각심을 갖고 북극곰과 북극 생태계를 보전하고 기후 변화에 대응하기 위해 노력해야 해요.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3e6d0512-54dc-4bf2-bd6c-770252b1e676\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-a5789c94-a877-4051-94e1-cf88a7cae56a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-37bf4a75-fe9f-4aec-9911-380dd5505335\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-40bc9208-a6f4-4b04-8f28-ce3150b91b5d\">사라지는 북극곰을 지키는 것처럼</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b166d79d-b76e-4ef5-a012-748a9e65365f\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unse